The social card of a resident of the Ivanovo region is recognized as an electronic means of payment.
The changes provide for the preservation of benefits for travel in public passenger transport.
From September 24 the procedure for organizing preferential travel of citizens using the social card of a resident of the Ivanovo region has been changing.
As reported by the press service of the Russian government in the Ivanovo region, the changes provide for the preservation of benefits for travel in public passenger transport and give a scheme of mutual settlements on a social map in accordance with the requirements of Federal Law No. 161 of the Federal Law “On the national payment system”.
At the same time, the social card of a resident of the Ivanovo region is recognized as an electronic means of payment.
Accordingly, the conditions of its application are changing.
So, the repletenment limit is now established not in trips, as before, but in the amount of funds, with the preservation of winter and summer periods - in winter not more than 400 rubles, in the summer - no more than 800 rubles for the current month.
Now holders of a social card on receipted receipts issued in transport will need to track not the number of remaining trips, but the residue of funds.
The cost of preferential fare for citizens will be 1/2 tariff applicable to the carrier.
The remaining half the cost of travel is compensated by the regional budget.
Schedule of replenishment of the social card of funds remains the same - in the period from 24 of the previous month to the 23rd of the current month.
A new order of travel on the social map will have a number of advantages.
So, there is an opportunity to keep a detailed account of the expenditure of money on the social card with an accuracy of pennies.
In addition, there is an opportunity to re-receipt the enrolled but unexpendited funds.
We will also add that the scheme of mutual settlements with carriers becomes transparent, since now a citizen pays half the cost of the proceeds, and exactly the same amount compensates the carrier for the budget.
There will be no commission when depositing funds on the card.
In turn, Vasily Silkin, the deputy head of the department of road and transport of the Ivanovo region, said that in 2014 more than 33 million trips were made in the region using a social card, in 2015 - almost 25 million trips.
In the regional budget for the provision of preferential fares of citizens using a social card provides more than 470 million rubles.
As of September 1, the amount of reimbursement for these purposes amounted to more than 312 million rubles.
