The government will decide the fate of the indexation of pensions in October.
Deputy Prime Minister Olga Golodets said that the government is now looking for options for the implementation of the law on the indexation of pensions in 2016 to a real level of inflation, reports RG.
She noted that the solution should be found by October 8, at the time of the introduction of the draft budget for the next year into the government.
In addition, the Cabinet of Ministers is discussing the possibility of prolonging the decision to froze the funded pension of the Russians.
Golodets noted that the amount of pension savings is equal to 350 billion rubles.
Approroximately the same is the indexation of pensions in full for the next year.
According to the vice-premier, so far there is no final decision on the question of who should pay contributions for non-developed citizens.
Golodets believes that if a person does not work on his own initiative and does not belong, at the same time, socially unsecured categories of citizens, it is not entirely fair that the society pays for it.
Earlier, the media reported that the Cabinet is considering two variants of balancing the state budget.
