Washington responded to Russia's military activity with a phone call.
US Secretary of state John Kerry called his Russian counterpart Sergei Lavrov to discuss the situation in Syria.
In his opinion, the military support that Moscow provides to the President of Assad leads only to an aggravation of the conflict.
At the same time, the head of the White house is not yet going to talk about it with his Russian counterpart, writes PJ Media.
U.S. Secretary of state John Kerry called Russia’s foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov in order to disprospect the military activity of Russia in Syria.
This is reported by PJ Media.
“Secretke Kerry has made it clear that Russia’s continued support for President Assad poses a risk of aggravation and prolongation of the conflict, as well as has a negative impact on our common goal - the fight against extremism - if we also do not continue to focus on finding ways to resolve the Syrian conflict through the direct transfer of power.
They also noted that Kerry has once again stressed the US commitment to the fight against the “Islamic state” within a coalition of more than 60 countries.
President al-Assad could never be a member.
In addition, the U.S. “would welcome Russia’s constructive role in attempts to confront the Islamic State.”
Last Friday, representatives of the White house said that they do not know exactly what actions Russian troops in Syria are taking, but Washington is going to discuss this issue with Moscow.
However, the press Secretary of the White house Josh Earnest noted that the time for a telephone conversation between U.S. President Barack Obama and the Russian leader Vladimir Putin has not yet come: “When the President decides that a phone conversation with President Putin will benefit our interests, then he will pick up the phone and try to make this call.”
Barack Obama himself considers the decision of Russia to increase support for the Assad regime with a “lose bet”.
I remember our conversation with Mr. Putin four or five years ago, when I told him it was a mistake that it was a glimpse that further support for Assad would only make things aggravate the situation.
“But he didn’t overwhelm my warnings, and as a result the situation has deteriorated,” he said.
The imported yachts will be exempt from paying customs duties.
The Ministry of Economic Exploration intends to temporarily vacate imported yachts and other floating funds for recreation and sports from the payment of customs duties and taxes.
Corresponding changes to the list of preferential goods for temporary duty-free imports were prepared by the ministry on behalf of the government of the Russian Federation.
About it “Izvestia” said the assistant Minister of economic development Elena Lashkin.
In June of 2015, the Prime Minister of the Russian Federation Dmitry Mégoved, after a trip to the Crimea, entrusted a number of departments - the Ministry of Economic Development, the Ministry of Transport of the Russian Federation, the Ministry of Culture, the Foreign Ministry, the Ministry of Emergencies Ministry, the FSB, FSB, Rostourism - to prepare proposals to create favorable conditions for yachting in the coastal zones of the country.
In turn, experts note that the main problem is a complete lack of infrastructure for storing, maintaining and maintaining yachts.
Owners prefer to store their ships abroad - approximately € 200 million annually goes to the treasury of European states for the maintenance, repair and maintenance of yachts.
The Ministry of economic development of Russia has prepared a draft decision of the Council of the Eurasian Economic Commission “On Amendments to the List of Goods Temporarily Imported With a Total Execution of Customary Duties”, which provides the provision of a complete conditional exemption from payment of customs duties, taxes in respect of imported yachts and other floating funds for recreation and sports.
According to the Ministry, this, of course, will contribute to the creation of favorable conditions for the development of yachting in the coastal areas of the country," Lashkina said.
This issue was submitted to the subcommittee on customs-tariff, non-tariff regulation, protective measures in foreign trade of the Government Commission on economic development and integration, a meeting of which took place in September, and as a result of the discussion it was also approved by departments.
As noted by the representative of the Ministry of economic development, the proposed measure for full conditional release during importation is in its essence a benefit.
Therefore, after approving the protocol of the sub-command meeting of the subcommittee in the government of the Russian Federation, the Ministry of Economic Development will submit a proposal to the Eurasian Economic Commission for discussion with the EAEU member states, Lashkina explained.
In the list of imported goods, which are completely exempt from payment of customs duties, taxes includes goods necessary to assist foreign economic activity and international cooperation, for use in the field of science, culture, cinematography, sports and tourism, for the provision of international assistance, etc.
In the press service of the Ministry of transport of the Russian Federation “Izvestia” said that they have prepared mandatory decrees on the sea ports of Kerch, Sevastopol, Yalta, Feodosia and Evpatoria, which provide for a simplified procedure for the registration of entry and the exit of low-dimensional, sports sailing and walking vessels to the seaport.
The Ministry of transport gave instructions to the captains of the sea ports of the Crimea to ensure the application of a simplified procedure for calling small-small, sports sailing and sliding ships to the seaport and the withdrawal of listed ships from the seaport.
The Ministry has also prepared draft orders of the Russian government to approximate the borders of the seaport of the Crimea.
In relation to Yalta and Feodosia orders have already been adopted, the rest are at the stage of coordination, the press service of the department noted.
According to the Ministry of transport, state supervision, classification and inspection, state registration in respect of small vessels used for non-commercial purposes should be carried out by the Republic of Crimea and Sevastopol.
The problem is that in Russia it is extremely difficult with yachting precisely because of the underdeveloped infrastructure.
If you look to the south of Italy and France, then there it is a whole constantly developing industry, in which a large number of people are involved.
In Russia, it’s actually everything in place.
Our coast is unsatisfactory, the only piece where you can use yachts year-of-the-number is the Black Sea in the region of Sochi, Gelendzhik, Novorossiysk, Anapa.
But a great difficulty is that in this area there are extremely stringent rules of the border service: in order to go for a baiary, you need to issue a lot of permits.
In addition, there is nowhere to refuel a yacht within Russia.
For two days it can go with its own fuel, and then there is a problem where to take it, ”says Denis Novikov, director of sales at Nordmarine.
As for places for storing yachts, in Moscow and St. Petersburg there are now special hangars for yachts of up to 30 morms. Yachts are also sent for storage to Turkey, Finland, Sweden and Germany.
Novikov noted that the buyers of yachts are rich people, but with the beginning of the crisis, the demand for yachts has decreased.
The world Bank has allocated a loan of $ 500 million to Ukraine
The world Bank has approved a new borrowed project for Ukraine in the amount of $ 500 million for the development of the financial sector.
This was reported by the press service of an international organization.
“The new financing will support a number of priority measures to carry out reforms in the banking sector in response to the financial crisis in Ukraine”, – stated in the message.
Tsimao Fan, Director of the World Bank for Belarus, Moldova and Ukraine, said that the reforms of the banking sector will help to revive loans in the real economy and will stimulate the restoration of economic growth.
He also noted that the Ukrainian authorities have taken impressive steps to reform the economy and at the World Bank are witnessing the first signs of stabilization.
But due to the seriousness of the problems, Fan calls on the Ukrainian government to accelerate the reforms.
Earlier, the Polish government approved the provision of a loan of € 100 million to Ukraine, RIA Novosti reports.
In prison, it is asked to create separate blocks for transgender people.
The Public Council under the Federal Penitentiary Service to protect the rights of convicted convicts in October 2015, among other issues will discuss the possibility of creating separate blocks in the colonies for transgender and transvestites in colonies.
About it “Izvestia” told Council member Vladislav Hryb.
In his opinion, depending on the total number of convicts in Russia who did not decide on the floor, it is possible to enforcing individual chambers, blocks or even (if there are many such criminals) in the long term to create a special colony for transgender people.
However, Vladislav Gryb emphasizes that it is possible to determine to serve the punishment of citizens in such isolated places only after the convicts pass the relevant medical examinations, which will prove that the offender is really a person who identifies himself as a representative of the opposite sex.
Vladislav Gryb is confident that the isolation of transgender persons from other prisoners will ensure the safety of those who are serving a sentence.
According to him, the proposed practice successfully operates abroad: in the pre-trial detention center (where the defendants are before the decision of the court) there are separate cameras for transgender people, and in correctional institutions - special blocks.
Today this is the only way to deal with such criminals.
Unequivocally they should be isolated, since the presence of transvestites and transgender people in ordinary cells is dangerous for them, this is suffering for their families and a sea of problems for FSIN employees.
Humiliating trances on the part of cellmates is guaranteed, - says Vladislav Grib.
Dependsing on how large the city, how many criminals with an unspecified scramble, you need to calculate where to distribute them.
SIZOs definitely do not need - only cameras, blocks in prison.
Yes, a separate colony is possible, if there are many transgender people.
As Gryb explained, the bloc can contain 50 or 100 people, and if a specialized corps will be created in Russia alone, transgender continolent prisoners will be able to go to serve their sentences from any regions.
Citizens are detained in a SIZO at the place of commission of a crime, so the arrival of transvestites or transgender people from other subjects during the investigation and the trial are unregistered, but to introduce such a practice for already convicts in a separate colony - yes.
We will remind, on the eve, law enforcement officers could not decide in which pre-trial detention - male or feminine - to determine a 24-year-old transsergist Dmitry Kozhukov (known under the name Alina Davis), because of which a man with a maiden appearance was not arrested.
He was recognized on a recognizance.
This news is widely discussed in social networks and the media, since there is really no mechanism for maintaining transgender in the pre-trial detention center and the colonies in Russia at the same time.
The Russian human rights defender Nikolai Alekzeev supported the idea of creating special places to serve the punishment of transgender people, noting that it is also possible to define people in the colony - male or female - regardless of their own desire.
Taking into account the atmosphere in Russian prisons, the proposal is correct.
“Yeah, this is a very small percentage, but the problem exists, as well as the question of ensuring security in prisons for homosexuals,” says Alekseev.
Jauries should be safe, so individual blocs can be done in the name for homosexuals, especially since there are more transgender people in prison than transgender people.
At the same time, Alekzeev doubted that in Russia there will be a lot of citizens who are ready to impersonate transactions in order to get to a separate colony from ordinary colonies.
Of course, you can introduce a medical examination before placing people in a colony for transgender people, but it does not always happen unequivourably.
For example, in the United States, one of Chelsea Munning prisoners looked like a man, and in a prison said that he wants to change the floor, ”said Alekseev.
A person can feel like anyone.
But as long as there are no separate places to serve a sentence for transgender people, I doubt that prison employees will seriously think about the safety of such people and get into the intricacies of their orientation or sexual identification.
At the same time, the international expert on Reproductive Duty-Health on the territory of the Russian Federation Boris Lordkipanidze noted that the introduction of a new system for the distribution of transgender-critical criminals in a colony can severely delay the beginning of serving their sentence by convicts.
A commission is created - this is a matter of sexology, psychiatrists carry out long-errectature observations, this is not one test on the basis on the basis of which a high-precision conclusion is made.
Current psychiatry capabilities allow this.
Therefore, before the change of the sex, potential patients always undergo such examinations - they accurately show whether a sex change with a surgical impatience is a necessary measure, ”says Lordkypanidze.
However, it is difficult for me to imagine how to introduce this system towards convicts, because on the average of such an examination takes a month.
The doctor, despite the fact that, in general the idea of creating separate blocks for transgender people, also doubts that in the current economic conditions it will be advisable to allocate funds for the construction of new premises, medical examinations - transgender units in Russia.
It is difficult to count, there are no official statistics, but if we take into account that there are about 5% homosexuals in Russia, we can be able to say that there are even fewer transgender people, and those who have such a deviation and also commits crimes are quite a small number.
At the request before the administration of the colony, homosexual, transgender citizens can already receive certain conditions of detention.
Mikhail Antipov won the Junior world chess championship.
In Khanty-Mansiysk ended the world chess championship among juniors for up to 20 years.
Confinement turned out to be more than an intriguing.
The winner was determined only in the last round, and he became the Russian Mikhail Antipov, who was still able to catch up with the Pole Yana-Krzyshtof Dudu, who seems to confidently went to the title.
Among the girls the victory was celebrated by the Ukrainian chess player Natalia Buksa.
The world chess championship, held since the beginning of September in Khanty-Mansiysk, already by the middle of the tournament distance, it seemed to have lost almost all the intrigue, since the representative of Poland Jan-Christztof Duda, who betrayed a series of four victories (commensurations are held according to the Swiss system in 13 rounds), confidently took the lead.
Taking into account that Duda was a rating-favorite of the championship, and in general is considered to be one of the most promising young chess players, the probability that he would miss the gap was very insignificant.
And even when Duda slowed and allowed the Russian Mikhail Antipov to reduce the lag to only 0.5 points, he remained an obvious favorite in the wrestling for the title.
After all, Antipov, in order to catch up with the leader, it was certainly necessary to win in round 13.
But even this wouldn’t have helped if you would win Dud your party.
In addition, this responsbilitation of victory, of course, could affect the game of the Russian chess player and lead to unobligatory mistakes.
Luckily, Mikhail Antipov managed to avoid them.
He coped with Frančsco Rambaldi confidently, after which he was forced to wait for Duda, who met with Benyamin Bock.
Luckily for Antipov, the Polish chess player reduced the confrontation with the Dutch diluted.
Thus, Antipov and Duda scored an equal number of points - 10 out of 13 possible, but Antipov had the best additional indicators.
And therefore it is his leadership of the Khanty-Mansiysk Autonomous Okrug, whose governor Natalia Komarova traditionally pays a lot of attention to chess development of chess in the region, was presented with the main prize.
But there was no intriguing ending girls in competition.
The leader of the tournament - Natalia Bukse (Ukraine) - it was enough not to lose in the last round, which she successfully did.
Thus, the victory of the Russian Alina Bivol did not allow her to catch up with Bucks.
The Russian athlete remained the second with a lag behind the champion of 0.5 points.
VimpelCom changes the regional structure.
The company unites the Volga and Ural regions into one large Volga-Ural region, Siberia and the Far East - the region of the East.
The project will be completed by November 1.
Mikhail Slobodin, general director of VimpelCom, noted, the changes are carried out in order to “remain a strong player on the market”, to develop the company “in a new, not always favorable for external conditions”.
In an interview with Rossiya 24, Mr. Slobodin said that they intend to reduce “tens of percent” of personnel in Russia.
Rospotrebnadzor checked for 78 Moscow snacks Burger King and issued 367 orders.
As a result, the restaurant on Volokolamsk highway was fined for 50 thousand rubles, and the institution on Bolshaya Tula street was closed for 90 days, but resumed work after the elimination of all violations.
43 snacks corrobated the requirements for the device of the premises.
Among other violations, unsatisfactory sanital sanitological and sanit and hygienic maintenance of the premises, non-comfort requirements for the veterinary veterinary system were detected in some institutions.
Franchise for the Burger King brand belongs to LLC "Burger Rus" owner of the network "Shokoladnitsa" Alexander Kolobov, in Russia there are 293 snack strollers.
Igor Artemyev, the head of the FAS, said that the agency is opposed to the indexation of tariffs for cargo transportation and the provision of state subsidiaries, as requested by Russian Railways.
At first they wanted 17% of the indexation, now they want 10%, and also multi-billion-dollar subsidies from the budget,” he says.
We say: it’s not wrong, it’s too much, reduce your costs, learn to save, abandon expensive manslaughters, football teams, your own TV, stop spending the money left and to the right.
He added that the FAS has its own “thosely more stringent” proposals, which are now being negotiated in the government.
Polymetal is considering a possible option for a net settlement with Sumeru Gold B.V. instead of executing a put-smart option for a total of $300 million, the gold mining company said.
In this case Polymetal you will have to cherish Sumeru up to $ 80 million (the difference is the share price in favor of Sumeru and market quotes), which can be taken from free cash flow.
Sumeru has the time until October 3 in order to exercise the option or demand an surcharge of surcharge.
Polymetal deals are undisclosed.
The option was concluded as part of Polymetal's purchase of the Kyzyl project in Kazakhstan.
Nikita Stashishin, director of the housing policy department of the Ministry of Construction, said that the Ministry, together with the Central Bank, is developing the procedure for reorganizing developers.
“We understand that there is no escape from this, so we are developing an appropriate mechanism”, – said the official.
Drawers of the script of “Citizen Kane” will be put up for auction.
Representatives of the auction house Profiles in History reported on plans to auction the final versions of the film “Citizen Kane”, which is considered to be one of the best works of the director, screenwriter and actor Orson Wells.
The Auction will begin in the city of Kalabas on September 29, it will present three draft versions of the scenario, the estimated cost of each of them is $ 20-30 thousand.
The first of the drafts, painted in 1940 by Hermann Mankiewicz, is the earliest script found in private collections? and is entitled as "An American" - such a working-age name for the film.
The second trim is a more complete version of the script, the third - the final plan of the film.
The Ministry of Prompt trade: targeted food assistance will not become an analogue of cards in the USSR.
Deputy Minister of Industry and Trade of Russia Viktor Evtukhov said that the program of targeted food assistance will not become an analogue of the card distribution system that existed in the U.S.
We are talking about modern targeted food assistance to the population and supporting an effective domestic commodity producer.
Please do not speculate on "Fuity Card".
I would like to especially point out that it should not be confuceded to confuse the proposed product cards with an edecoph of the past times of total deficit, the distribution card system in which the amount of products obtained is normalized.
While we have already proposed the concept, if it is approved, we will propose amendments to the legislation”, – quotes TASS the words of Mr Evtukhov.
Earlier, Kommersant wrote that the program for the introduction of food stamps for the Poor was submitted to the government.
To read more about the initiative of the Ministry of Industry and Trade in the material "Kommersant" "Igor Shuvalov instructed to prepare grocery maps."
Rosgosstrakh wants to divorce his wife.
Familiar with the situation the source told RAPSI that Danil Khachaturov, the president of the Rosgosstrakh insurance company Danil Khachaturov appealed to the court of Moscow with a claim about the dissolution of the marriage with the designer Ulyana Sergienko.
For the consideration of the lawsuit of the ceremonial precinct of the magistrate number 100 will begin on September 16.
Daniil Khachaturov asks to dissolve his marriage and divide the jointly acquired property.
In the court confirmed the presence of a claim about the dissolution of the marriage in the proceedings, noting that there was no claim to divide the property and will be considered in the district court.
The President of Russian Railways Alexander Bobreshov leaves his post.
The vice-president of JSC "Russian Railways" (RZhD) on corporate security Alexander Bobreshov leaves the company, reports "Interfax", referring to the source.
The Deputy Prime Minister of Russia, the Chairman of the Board of Directors of Russian Railways Arkady Dvorkovich said that the issue of leaving Russian Railways Alexander Bobreshov was initiated by the new head of the company Oleg Belozerov.
According to the vice-premier, the personnel reshuffles in the management of Russian Railways are not associated with the change of the head of the company.
Earlier "Kommersant" reported that instead of Vladimir Yakunin, Russian Railways was headed by the first deputy minister of transport St. Petersburg Oleg Belozerov, who oversteered the financial block.
The new head of the company for the first time announced reforms in a monopoly: for a year and a year and a half will create a new system of freight tariffs.
To read more about the changes in the company in the material of "Kommersant" "RZD will rewrite prices."
In the current year, the study of the Association of Russian Managers “Top-1000 Russian managers” comes out for the 16th time.
Being an instrument for assessing the professional reputation of Russian higher echelon managers, the study sums up the work of Russian managers for a year, identifying leaders in industries and functional areas.
Initial pool of the candidates consists of last year's rating laureates.
The winners of last year are invited to reprove their participation as a rating candidate of this year and nominate members of their management team.
In addition, it is proposed that each of the candidates included in the original list is proposed to nominate up to ten new managers from other companies, which it would be advisable to add to a general pool of candidates.
Possible nominating the following managers of functional areas of the company: Cygnator, Commercial Director, Marketing Director, HR Director, Director of Public and Corporate Liabilities, Director for Relations with Authorities, Corporate Governance.
An invitation is sent an invitation to participate in the rating to each expert by the experts and an opportunity to nominate their management team and up to ten new executives from other companies.
The nomination of candidates according to the industry principle is carried out on the basis of an industry classifier of the Association of managers: information technologies, commercial banks, timber and timber processing industry, mechanical engineering, media business, metallurgy, multidisciplinary holdings, professional services, communications and telecommunications, service and production of consumer goods, insurance, construction, trade, transport, the financial sector, pharmaceuticals, the chemical industry.
Each participant is provided with a login and password for logging to the website www.top1000.ampr.ru, where they can see information about other participants and can put their own grades according to the criteria proposed for each functional direction.
At the basis of the methodology for constructing the rating lies the principle of "The best to choose the best": top managers evaluate top managers, functional managers evaluate functional managers.
such a principle allows you to obtain the most authentic assessment of the professional reputation of colleagues.
The final results of the rating are approved at meetings of the expert commissions.
To face-to-creating meetings of the expert commissions are invited to all interested candidates of the rating of the current year and repeated candidates of the rating of previous years.
Commissions are organized on a functional basis: a commission to approte a list of senior leaders and eight commissions to appruise the heads of functional areas.
At meetings of expert commissions, it is proposed to approximate these lists in an alphabetical manner (the seats are kept strictly according to an Internet assessment and are classified information before the publication of the rating) or to make actualizing their adjustments according to the attached list of reserve candidates.
The names of the companies are given in accordance with the rules of the Russian language and the norms of Kommersant.
At the time of publication of the rating, there may be changes in the status of managers and companies.
Comfortable bet for an investment loan - 10-13%.
According to analysts, the market for lending to small and medium-sized businesses in January-April of this year fell by 40%.
What do you estimate what the situation is today?
After pascinate mood of the end of 2014 - beginning of 2015, SME lending volumes decreased significantly.
The reason is understandable: a sharp increase in interest rates.
Lending under 25-30% per anniversaries was not favorable to anyone.
If earlier the bank was able to lay all its possible problems in an increased rate in the future, from delays to no-returns, now it is impossible to do: bets are already sky-high.
For business, the current level of interest rates on SME loans is uncomfortable.
For a significant part of investment projects, the current level is unacceptable in terms of their payback.
Betting level of 10-13% would allow the business to invest in a wide range of projects and form an attractive profitability on them.
To what, according to your estimates, is the demand of entrepreneurs for loans satisfied?
After the Central Bank's downgrade of the interest rate, the situation has slightly improved slightly.
Loan resources have become more accessible.
However, according to our observations, customers began to apply for loans much less often.
First of all, the business does not understand the prospects of its development and future revenues.
Today there is only one way in business: it is necessary to learn to work, focusing on the current economic situation in the country and the region.
It is necessary to more carefully monitor the current results, monitor the movement of funds.
At the same time, in the presence of financial resources, it is necessary to use new technologies to modernize the equipment, to reduce the cost of production and energy supply.
All this, in the end, allows the company to make the products more competitive and keep the business even in an unstable economic situation.
What are the main trends of SME lending market will strengthen and will influence its development by the end of 2015?
Will the interest rate change?
The prognosis to reduce the average rate will largely depend on the policy of the Central Bank, and now the regulator demonstrates consistency in reducing the key rate.
However, there is no need to wait for a radical drop in the loan price for SMEs.
In the current situation, the problem, in the first place, is inflation, which makes an increased interest rate necessary to generate a real income.
In addition, the cost of money in Russia will remain high even with a decrease in CB.
If we talk about the level of overderimilarity, traditionally small and medium-sized companies, limited both in the possibilities of replenishing funds, and in the options for correcting economic behavior, of course, will pose a greater risk to lenders.
I wouldn’t look forward to a significant reduction in the share of bad loans.
The main reason – international sanctions and their negative impact on the country’s economy.
