The speaker of the state Duma Sergey Naryshkin admits that the United States deliberately destabilizes the situation in the Middle East so that the waves of refugees rush to Europe.
According to “Interfax”, such an opinion he told reporters in Ulyan-Bathor within the framework of the autumn session of the OSCE Parliamentary Assembly.
“I am not a supporter of conspiratorial theorists, but the question arises for itself: is Europe the ultimate goal of those with such maniacal perseverance destabilized the situation in the countries of North Africa and the Middle East in recent years?”
After havoc, for sure, someone imagined and knew that the flow of refugees, these unfortunate and dispossessed people who were fleeing from their death will rush to the prosperous countries of the European Union,” he said.
Naryshkin asked: “Have many political leaders of Europe frankly spoke about the causes of this crisis, this wave of refugees, which now literally overwhelms their countries?”
“No, the old Europe, with rare exceptions, prefers to remain silent,” he said.
According to Naryshkin, NATO blunders many European values and norms of international law.
“Unfortunately, Europe for a long and unfacilittably look and looks at how a military sabogo, stitched according to the standards of NATO, moral and basic fundamental principles and the norms of international law are trampled,” the speaker said.
corporatizing troops are confronted by rebels, consisting mainly of Islamists.
