Borodai called the information of the American newspaper a slander against Strelkov.
The former Chairman of the government of the self-proceded Donetsk people's Republic Alexander Boroday denied the information that was published in the American newspaper The Washington Post.
About it he said in a telephone interview to the correspondent of “Lenta.ru”.
Note in the Washington Post is beautiful in the fact that everything is completely reversed there.
The former DPR defense Minister Igor Strelkov, of course, did not bind and he “leaked” from the territory of the republics of the Trans-Abass in a very elevated mood, without ropes, without three trucks of money, which are attributed to him by different characters,” he said.
According to Borodai, we are talking about Strelkov in a conversation with a reporter of an American newspaper was really going on.
“Yeah, I said that Strelkov urgently needed to be removed from the territory of the Donetsk people’s Republic”, – said the former head of the DPR government.
Borodai stressed that he does not know why the correspondent of the American edition decided to write that Strelkov was taken to the territory of Russia “connected”.
I'm suspecting it's a provocative.
If this is not a provocative thing, then these are amazingly misunderstood words, since I stressed that Strelkov was leaving myself, ”said Borodai.
“This is slander against both me and Strelkov,” he concluded.
Previously, an article was published on the pages of The Washington Post, which cites the words of Bogorad that he took Strelkov to the territory of Russia forcibly.
According to the publication, Borodai noted that he was forced to connect his colleague.
The Polish authorities began to look for a train with the gold of the Nazis.
Polish lumber of rubbits began to cut down trees above an underground tunnel, where, according to some reports, there is a train with the golden of the Third Reich.
The work began on Tuesday, September 15, according to Reuters.
According to military experts, it is Necessary to clear the forest in order to test the reliability of rumors about the railway composition with the Treasure.
Inside the train there can be weapons and valuable minerals.
On August 31, the Governor of the Polish Nizhnesile Voivodeship Tomasz Smolars (Tomasz Smolarz) suggested that new evidence for the existence of a train with gold is not at all more convincing than the previous.
However, the authorities decided to unsecret the area of the search.
For three days earlier, the Deputy Minister of culture of Poland Pyotr Zhuhovsky said that local treasure hunters with a “probability of 99 percent” found the same train with the gold of the Third Reich, which is mentioned in the legends.
Zhukhovsky noted that if the assumptions are confirmed and the jewels are found, they will become the property of the state treasury, while the Treasons will not be transferred to Russia.
In the middle of August, two clients of the law firm appealed to the authorities of the Polish city of Valbzhikh with a message that a train was found in a swirled tunnel at a depth of 70 meters.
The chief narcologist of the Russian Federation proposed to prohibit the sale of tobacco to persons under the age of 21.
The main narcologist of Russia proposed to prohibit the sale of tobacco up to 21 years.
Yevgeny Bryun noted that until this age "any psychoactive substance - tobacco, alcohol, drug - acts especially detrimental."
So he said in a live radio station “Moscow Speaks”, commenting on the information that the speaker of the Federation Council Valentina Matviyenko supported the idea of banning the sale of alcohol to citizens under the age of 21.
A person ripens unequivourably.
You can serve in the army from the age of 18, a person is physically ready for this.
Psychically he is ready for a full-fledged life in society from the age of 21.
“There is a well-known from the scientific data that the brain, its biochemistry finally ripens until the age of 21,” Brün said.
Sultan Khamzayev, a member of the Public Chamber and the leader of the Sober-Wasy Russia project, told Izvestia that Matviyenko supported the initiative to raise the age limit for the sale of alcohol and “agreed together with the Public Chamber to raise this issue again on the site of the upper house of parliament”.
According to the activist, a working group will soon be created in the Federation Council to develop a bill led by Matvienko.
Biblika was requested to be checked for compliance with the law on the information protection of the children
A resident of Novosibirsk appealed to the regional prosecutor's office with a request to check the Biblical Bible for Compliance with the federal law "On the protection of children from the information that causes harm to their health and development", a statement on September 16 was familiarized by the correspondent of Sb.
The author of the appeal stated that on August 26, 2015 he purchased in the store "Receit-City" on Krasny Prospekt Biblika, published in 2013 by the Russian Biblical Society.
In the text of the book, he found fragments that, in his opinion, violate the Federal Law “On the protection of children from information harmful to their health and development”.
On September 16, the application was accepted for consideration by the prosecutor's office of Novosibirsk.
The response to a resident of Novosibirsk will be answered within 30 days.
It’s far from banning a book.
It is much more interesting to demonstrate the absurdity of the law itself, - commented the applicant to the correspondent of Sib.
In addition, this is quite a fundamental problem that will stir up society.
It will begin to re-read the Bible, which hasn’t done before.
