Google Inc (GOOGL.O) has launched a donation doubling campaign designed to raise $11 million for humanitarian organizations that are assisting enclosing European refugees who are fleeing war-torn and impoverished countries.
“Google has used an uncharacteristic personal approach by announcing a donation-gathering campaign on its blog.
