Do not forget about the human qualities of the citizens.
For example, Leonid Garbar is sure that St. Petersburg has always been a hospitable city in which people don’t just tell the way, but they can also conduct a mini-examination.
Complications also occur.
My father in the year in the yard in the yard met a family from Murmansk - a father, a mother and two children.
